README - Tables and Figures Folder

subfolders in this subdirectory ( "04-Tables-Figures/" ):

"01-main-analysis" -- the "national" analysis, i.e, results of the models fit
on JHU and CDC data for all counties in all states included in the analysis.
Results files come from the R script in "R/04-primary-analysis-inla.R"

"02-northeast-analysis" - "05-west-analysis"-- 
results files for the models on JHU and CDC data but stratifed on Census region.
Results files come from the R script in "R/04-primary-analysis-inla.R"

"06-sensitivity-analyses" -- results files from the sensitivity analyses (there is
another README file inside this folder describing its contents). 
Results files come from the R scripts in "R/sensitivity-analyses"

"07-combination-plots" -- .pptx, .pdf, ad image files for large plots/graphs
that were combined using powerpoint given that they were too large to arrange 
with `ggarrange`.

"08-other-supplementary-files" -- sample flow diagram and Moran's I plots.
Results files come from the R script in "R/03-descriptives.R"